<main id="main-content">
    

<section class="p-normal page-header front-page">
    <div class="backdrop" style="background-image: url(&#x27;/cdn-cgi/image/width=2560,format=auto,quality=75/contentassets/047e85cd5b1143ff947c296bea4c026e/back_new_6.jpg?v=9f58d8db&#x27;);" role="img">
    </div>
    <div class="backdrop2" style="background-image: url(&#x27;/cdn-cgi/image/width=2560,format=auto,quality=85/contentassets/047e85cd5b1143ff947c296bea4c026e/front_new_6.png?v=9f58d8dc&#x27;);" role="img"></div>
    
    <div class="inner-front-page">
            <h1 class="visually-hidden">The Norwegian Government Pension Fund Global</h1>
        
            <div class="live-number-title pt-8">
                The fund&#x27;s value <span class="blinking-dot no-animation">&nbsp;</span>
            </div>
            <span>
                <span id="liveNavNumber" class="live-number big" 
                       data-key="263c30dd-d5ba-41d6-a9b1-c1fb59cf30da" 
                       data-lang="en-GB"
                       data-show-full-number="true"></span>
                <span class="currency">nok</span>
            </span>

        <div class="live-number-description">
            <hr>
            
<p style="text-align: center;">We work to safeguard and build financial wealth for future generations</p>
        </div>
        
            <div class="pt-8">
                <a href="/en/investments/the-funds-value/" class="btn semi-transparent" data-right-icon="east" data-animation-direction="right">
                    Value development
                </a>
            </div>
    </div>
</section>



<section class="content-split reverse pt-none pb-large">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content-split-wrapper">

           
                <div class="content-one"></div>
            
            <div class="content-two">
                    <h2>About the fund</h2>
                
                
<p>The aim of the fund is to ensure a long-term management of revenue from Norway’s oil and gas resources, so that this wealth benefits both current and future generations. The fund’s formal name is the Government Pension Fund Global.</p>

                <ul class="chevron-links"><li><a href="/en/about-us/about-the-fund/" class="chevron-link" >About the fund</a></li></ul>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="content-split  sky-light pt-large pb-normal">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content-split-wrapper">

           
                <div class="content-one">
                    <h2>How the fund is invested</h2>
                </div>
            
            <div class="content-two">
                
                
<p>The Government Pension Fund Global is one of the world's largest funds. Investments are spread across most markets, countries and currencies to achieve broad exposure to global growth and value creation while ensuring good risk diversification. The fund invests only abroad so that the Norwegian economy does not overheat.</p>

                <ul class="chevron-links"><li><a href="/en/investments/" class="chevron-link" >More on how we invest</a></li></ul>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
