</section>

<section class="content-split  pt-large pb-none">
    <div class="container">
        <div class="content-split-wrapper">

           
                <div class="content-one">
                    <h2>The fund&#x27;s history</h2>
                </div>
            
            <div class="content-two">
                
                
<p>The idea of a Norwegian oil fund was conceived in the 1960s when the government claimed sovereignty over the Norwegian continental shelf. This laid the foundation for Norway's approach to pertroleum resource management, based on parliamentary guidelines that ensure responsible, long-term management under strong governmental control.</p>

                <div class="flex gap-4 flex-col"><div><a href="/en/about-us/about-the-fund/the-history/" class="btn btn-secondary" data-right-icon="east" data-animation-direction="right">See the full story</a></div></div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
