                <div class="text-and-image-sub-block-card">


<h2>The fund&#x27;s value</h2>

<div class="max-w-xs">
    <p>
        The fund&#x27;s value is driven by investment returns. The value is also affected by capital inflow and withdrawals, and exchange rate movements.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="flex gap-4 flex-col"><div><a href="/en/investments/the-funds-value/" class="btn btn-primary" data-right-icon="east" data-animation-direction="right">The fund's value</a></div></div>
</div>
            
                <div class="text-and-image-sub-block-card">


<h2>Return on the investments</h2>

<div class="max-w-xs">
    <p>
        Return on the investments accounts for more than half of the fund&#x27;s value. Since 1998 the fund has generated an average annual return of 6.86 percent, or 15,210 billion kroner.
    </p>
</div>

<div class="flex gap-4 flex-col"><div><a href="/en/investments/returns/" class="btn btn-primary" data-right-icon="east" data-animation-direction="right">Returns</a></div></div>
</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</section>



