            </div>
            <div class="content-two">
                <h2 >Get to know the CEOs of the world&#x27;s largest companies</h2>
                <div>
                    
<p>In our podcast 'In Good Company', CEO Nicolai Tangen interviews leaders of some of the world's largest companies, including OpenAI's Sam Altman, Novo Nordisk CEO Lars Fruegaard J&oslash;rgensen and Ferrari CEO Benedetto Vigna. You get to know the leader, their strategies, and how they engage with a large investor like us.</p>
                </div>

                <div class="flex gap-4 flex-col"><div><a href="/en/news-and-insights/podcast/" class="btn btn-primary" data-right-icon="east" data-animation-direction="right">In Good Company</a></div></div>
